# NOTE: GHC and cabal are *not* listed here. The versions this project needs
# (see .tool-versions) are not the ones Debian ships, so the build environment
# in pkg/Dockerfile.deb-builder installs them with ghcup instead. Everything
# below is a C library that the Haskell packages bind to, and must be kept in
# sync with the apt-get line in that Dockerfile.
